        <item>
            <title>1.3.14</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 20 Sep 2026 13:55:36 +0200</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>10314</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.3.14</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>MotionUI 1.3.14</h2>
<ul>
  <li>MotionUI Agent sends frames again: send a selection, rasterize it, create an empty comp, create a frame from your open comp, all in the same window that shows the connection and the assistant. Figma only runs one plugin at a time, so working with Claude no longer means switching back and forth.</li>
  <li>The Figma tab says it plainly now: the plugin from the Community is the one to hand out, the Agent does the same and adds Claude in the file.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
